# LEGADO: serviço anterior ao protótipo do TCC II (imagem da API legada; não fixa a configuração Jev v2). Para o protótipo atual (A''-J v2 com a
# interface Bisco), use compose.demo.yaml e scripts/start-local.cmd, na raiz do repositório.
FROM python:3.12.3-slim

WORKDIR /app/code

ENV UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT="/usr/local/"
ENV UV_COMPILE_BYTECODE=1
ENV PYTHONPATH="/app/code/src"

COPY code/pyproject.toml .
COPY code/uv.lock .
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir uv
RUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --no-dev

COPY code/src/agents/ ./src/agents/
COPY code/src/core/ ./src/core/
COPY code/src/memory/ ./src/memory/
COPY code/src/schema/ ./src/schema/
COPY code/src/service/ ./src/service/
COPY code/src/rag_baseline/ ./src/rag_baseline/
COPY code/src/run_service.py ./src/run_service.py

# Documentary runtime dependencies of NormativeRegistry.load, not experiment results.
COPY data/normative_registry.json /app/data/normative_registry.json
COPY evaluation/corpora/graduacao_setor_v2.json /app/evaluation/corpora/graduacao_setor_v2.json
COPY evaluation/corpora/pos_graduacao_setor_v2.json /app/evaluation/corpora/pos_graduacao_setor_v2.json
COPY evaluation/corpora/1056_2026_temporal_v1.json /app/evaluation/corpora/1056_2026_temporal_v1.json

CMD ["python", "src/run_service.py"]
